{
  // Blue Mage Set Builder profiles.
  //
  // Each profile lists picks in priority order, and each pick fills one slot. "Spell"
  // is a Blue Magic Spellbook number (the same in every language), or a list of them
  // in order of preference, where a later spell stands in when you have not learned
  // the earlier one. The comment after each pick names its spells. A spell you have
  // excluded, or that is already in the set, is skipped. Picks run until all 24
  // slots are full; anything after that is ignored.
  //
  // "Group" is the tab a profile appears under. "Role" (Tank, Healer or DPS) is
  // optional; when every profile in a group has one, that tab shows a Role picker.
  //
  // These are starting points, not gospel. Export them from Settings, edit the copy
  // in your config folder, and press Reload.
